 class="font-bold text-ink">Back squat:</span> <span class="font-semibold text-ink">Last time: 132.5 lb × 8. Today: 137.5 lb × 8.</span></li><li class="text-sm tabular-nums"><span class="font-bold text-ink">Push-ups:</span> <span class="font-semibold text-ink">Last time: 10 reps. Today: 12 reps.</span></li></ul></div><div class="border-t border-line p-4"><p class="text-sm font-bold text-ink">What changes next time</p><p class="mt-0.5 text-xs text-muted">Based on what you logged today, your plan already adjusted:</p><ul class="mt-2 space-y-1.5"><li class="text-sm"><span class="font-bold text-ink">Back squat:</span> <span class="text-body">Go up to 142.5 lb and drop back to 6 reps.</span></li><li class="text-sm"><span class="font-bold text-ink">Bench press:</span> <span class="text-body">Same weight, one more rep per set.</span></li></ul></div><div class="border-t border-line p-4 bg-banana-soft/70"><p class="mb-2 text-xs font-extrabold text-banana-ink">New level unlocked</p><div class="flex items-center gap-2.5"><span class="grid place-items-center shrink-0 rounded-xl size-11 bg-banana "><img aria-hidden="true" title="Banana verde" alt="" loading="lazy" width="64" height="64" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="inline-block shrink-0 rounded-full bg-banana object-cover ring-1 ring-ink/10 size-7 text-ink!" style="color:transparent" sizes="64px" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fd8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net%2Fuser_3KlOTMXim7g88SAyF4A03SG6JZ6%2Fhf_20261023_174922_dea3eb35-e693-4059-b8e2-0a1673419851_min.webp&amp;w=16&amp;q=75 16w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fd8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net%2Fuser_3KlOTMXim7g88SAyF4A03SG6JZ6%2Fhf_20261023_174922_dea3eb35-e693-4059-b8e2-0a1673419851_min.webp&amp;w=32&amp;q=75 32w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fd8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net%2Fuser_3KlOTMXim7g88SAyF4A03SG6JZ6%2Fhf_20261023_174922_dea3eb35-e693-4059-b8e2-0a1673419851_min.webp&amp;w=48&amp;q=75 48w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fd8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net%2Fuser_3KlOT